    "text": "$-23$"
   }
  ],
  "answer": "E",
  "acceptedAnswers": null,
  "answerUnit": null,
  "solutions": [
   {
    "title": "Minimize each part",
    "body": "Make $xy$ as small as possible and $z$ as large as possible. $xy$ is smallest when $x$ and $y$ have opposite signs and large size: $(-2)(7)=-14$ or $(5)(-3)=-15$; the minimum is $-15$. With $z=8$: $w=-15-8=-23$.\n\n**Answer: (E) $-23$**"
   }
